     1,
     "Hello,<div>I had a problem when  pasting the TxtInOut folder path in R-SWAT. It  suddenly closes and t<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">hen it brought me back to RStudio showing the message:</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,153);background-color:rgb(15,15,15)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,153);background-color:rgb(15,15,15)\">Warning: Error in nchar: invalid multibyte string, element 1\r\n</span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">  48: </span><span style=\"background-color:white\">getInfoHruHeader\r\n  47: getHruInfo\r\n  46: <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">observe [C:\\Users\\acer\\AppData\\Local\\R\\win-library\\4.3\\RSWAT\\R-SWAT/server.R#618]</span>\r\n  45: &lt;observer&gt;\r\n   2: shiny::runApp\r\n   1: showRSWAT</span></font></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">I asked </span></font></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Tam V. Nguyen about it and the problem was all my .hru files had an unusual space character in the first line between &quot;a. m&quot; </span><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/2mJ2L5wFkFrXapdt8XfVypYjhRMt8yWvEit3K4kWFO_rVm5hu49LhLXcEkpfxWrDMJckyjavqi2cRSv_zdM65HCVoFJTj9s0BHgSK57Gz0_C3YoR1wCNIoBaxg4DQWJv68XtyBcHXZ33Cov4q3caJTD_PpVhA0TShPYlV20KHLOps5idiL0XMyOY8qnBa6ATII3Ygc7w6-V7etEW0DMtzTBq7HSPlLbcip3VkXZz_n5q1WVQSNjE98zTHVsZfmzWzYNbFeQMb3eLx4uQpsDtKPa_etKuUk0ABmFR4gUYIzxGus9IPpg2Fuj6slgVInENaNMpkZLsauY9468JMwgadZI6UMgTeACTclHIaqqMyaanro63Dm5KApMFA-_VwsMBjIpHB5gCBzsPhtM5ZHdCP0CNGrScczYtJg=s0-d-e1-ft#https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0?ui=2&amp;ik=703c991fe8&amp;attid=0.1.1&amp;permmsgid=msg-f:1808816462769475986&amp;th=191a34fd4740d192&amp;view=fimg&amp;fur=ip&amp;sz=s0-l75-ft&amp;attbid=ANGjdJ96K-HfzlgM_lrZgooIoNYlOKPzCCbOWQrnHCNLqnZrfMtsJGVMuxFSetHKTfh1DqfiSDA1plcc8OHvml8VjpdGFEZ4BQ9rQ7UkmmYmlHy5IJaHz3QOA-eivQM&amp;disp=emb\" style=\"font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><b>SOLUTION:</b> <span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"> use this command in RStudio:</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><b>Sys.setlocale( &#39;LC_ALL&#39;,&#39;C&#39; )</b><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">showRSWAT()</p></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Once I did that, the problem was solved.</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Hope it helps!</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Best to all,</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Rayén Rivera Vidal</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><div style=\"color:rgb(80,0,80)\"><font color=\"#999999\">Geóloga UdeC</font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(80,0,80)\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin:0px\"><span lang=\"ES-CR\" style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><font color=\"#999999\">Doctora(c) en Ciencias Ambientales con mención en Sistemas Acuáticos Continentales</font></span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#999999\"><span lang=\"ES-CR\" style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\">Facultad de Ciencias Ambientales – Centro EULA</span><span style=\"font-size:8pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></font></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin:0px\"><span lang=\"ES-CR\" style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><font color=\"#999999\">Universidad de Concepción - Chile</font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-size:8pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font size=\"1\" color=\"#999999\">Registro Orcid <a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7327-6372\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7327-6372&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240960908000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3isgXlMqDr95Eq6Ilj02lh\">orcid.org/0000-0001-7327-6372</a></font></p></div></div>"
